      "statement":"A surface names the exact identity, such as path and digest, of every derivation source and every source whose change can change its content. It is current only while all named identities equal the selected basis identities; any change makes it stale. No stale surface is used as current for any question. Currentness is restored only by regeneration from selected-basis sources or explicit re-acceptance recording new source identities and a finding that content still matches; meanwhile deciding owners are acquired directly. Identity matches establish provenance alone, neither fidelity nor sufficiency. Selected-basis owners decide question-specific insufficiency and overreach; the surface never judges these about itself. Packaging and installation carriers refine identities and re-acceptance procedures while naming this subsection as owner; PRODUCT_DEFINITION §11 is identified as the released-carrier application.",
