      "statement":"The source's work-state/reuse family has extra premises a persistent workspace, b work spanning activations, c changing actors and d open-world effects. Its six rows are: work-state object, P3/P0 with a,b, pillars 2,5, carrier chosen by profile/realisation; workspace versus account, P0/P3/P4b/P6 with a,c, pillars 6,9, recovery observations chosen by resuming intake plus work state; effect reconciliation, P5/P6 with d, pillars 4,5, no added choice; checkpoint/progress, P2/P6 with b, pillar 5, projections chosen by consumer; closed handoff/reuse, P4b/P0/P6 with c, pillars 7,9, revising observations and other invalidation conditions declared by producer; transition evidence, P5/P6 with c, pillar 9, representation chosen by consumer. The proportionality/cost family has extra premises a selected outcome, b complexity-adding obligations, c a governed cost claim and d bounded-resource consumption. Its six rows are proportionality P2/P0 with b, pillars 6,7, once-per-family rationale by owning law; symbolic design P2/P0/P1 with b, pillars 4,6, no added choice; execution purpose P2/P0/P6 with b, pillars 7,9, no added choice; cost P0/P2 with c, pillar 8, allowance by activation and measurement boundary/unit by execution binding; resource limits P0/P5/P6/P2 with d, pillars 8,7, values and measurable units/boundaries by execution binding; delivery priority P2/P0 with a, pillars 1,5, SPEC_METHOD §8 chooses the smallest supported product path first and prioritises likelihood, impact, reversibility, dependency and delayed feedback without probability waiving hard stops. These are source-authored derivation accounts, not proofs performed here. P0 is labelled recovered; P1/P2/P3/P6 independent; P5 derived from P0/P6 with the open-world premise; P4b derived from P0/P2 with non-reacquirable step-produced facts. Instance premises are not commitments and do not follow from finite capacity alone. Consumer applications add no determination beyond their owning rule.",
