      "statement":"An unchanged consumer may reuse a result after checking exact applicability. Affectedness is described as dependencies D*(t) meeting impact cover I(Δ). Before reliance, invalidate results affected by material subject/input/evidence change capable of changing value, any changed bound basis coordinate, or occurrence of a declared revising observation. This applies even if subject bytes are unchanged, while preserving predecessor/successor links and demonstrably independent survivors. Invalidation withdraws direct reliance; retain_applicable separately governs retaining evidence on a new basis, and changed coordinates alone establish neither truth nor falsity. Source/task/actor condition changes are basis changes if bound there, otherwise material input changes; role/conversation/resumption changes alone invalidate nothing unless required actor conditions change. Domain triggers instantiate these three kinds, never a parallel list. Judgment continuity names basis/evidence; Return A Closed Result names inputs/observation. Reuse cannot satisfy a separately required independent judgment; an independent assessor acquires its own evidence and gives its own judgment, subject to the permission for shared valid mechanical evidence. Frame revision-coordinate need belongs to REFERENCE_FRAME §10, touched-result validity to this reuse law.",
